 "headingtext_pnaiaryq6a_html": "Our Journey: A Family Legacy",
 "textcontent_ewmhc8huspr_html": "Our story began with Abdul Majid, who laid the foundation for our butchery business in Oman in 1977. His son, Naveed Ahmed, continued the tradition by founding Muscat Livestock in 2008, marking the beginning of a new chapter. Despite challenges like COVID-19, we adapted and thrived, transforming into a successful e-commerce platform in Oman. Now, under the guidance of brothers Naveed &amp; Nadeem Ahmed, we're expanding into the UAE, with over 15 MLS Gourmet stores in Oman paving the way. \u2028",
